Results are clear:

- **C1**: Supported — 10-Q (Q1 2024) explicitly states AWS sales increased 17% YoY. Citable.
- **C2**: Conflicted — the $4.8B figure is Q1 **2023** operating income; Q1 2024 operating income was actually $15.3B per the same filing. Claim as worded misattributes the period and must not be published as-is.
- **C3**: Insufficient — no evidence in the corpus (SEC filings) addresses Trainium inference market share; this is a market-share/analyst-estimate type claim not found in GAAP filings. Cannot be verified from this source set.

